{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38915","headline":"春日山中对雪有作 · 杜荀鹤","name":"春日山中对雪有作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹树无声或有声，霏霏漠漠散还凝。\n岭梅谢後重粧蘂，岩水铺来却结冰。\n牢系鹿儿防猎客，满添茶鼎候吟僧。\n好将膏雨同功力，松径莓苔又一层。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38915.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38915","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}